      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (5)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_11__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_11__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “The Land Administrator” dengan perkataan “In addition to the award made under subsection 14(1), the Land Administrator”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_11__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_11__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “imposed by the valuer” dengan perkataan “prescribed by rules”. Seksyen baharu 19a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 19 seksyen yang berikut: “Enquiry and award by the Land Administrator pursuant to Certificate of Urgency 19a. (1) Notwithstanding that possession of the land has been taken pursuant to a Certificate of Urgency issued under section 19, the Land Administrator shall continue to make full enquiry and make an award in accordance with the provisions of this Act. (2) Where the possession of the land has been taken under section 19, subsection 8(4) shall not be applicable if the Land Administrator has not made an award under subsection 14(1) within the said period of two years.”. Pindaan seksyen 21"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Perenggan 21(2)(a) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memotong perkataan “competent”. Pindaan seksyen 22"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
