      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_15",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (a), dengan menggantikan perkataan “parcel of a subdivided building, in the” dengan perkataan “parcel of a subdivided building or land, in the statutory body,”. Pindaan seksyen 26"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen 26(3) subseksyen yang berikut: “(4) Where part of a subdivided building or land is acquired under this Act, the proper registering authority shall take necessary action in accordance with the Strata Titles Act 1985.”. Pindaan seksyen 28"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
