      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menomborkan semula seksyen yang sedia ada sebagai subseksyen (1); dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_17__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) yang dinomborkan semula itu subseksyen yang berikut: “(2) For the purpose of subsection (1), the difference specified shall not exceed one quarter of a hectare or one percentum of the area of scheduled land as published in the Gazette under subsection 8(1), whichever is the greater, and such difference shall not be necessary for any further declaration to be made and published.”. Pindaan seksyen 29"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
