      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_21__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (1b), dengan menggantikan perkataan “eight” dengan perkataan “five”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_21__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (1c) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(1c) In this section “due date” in relation to any land means— (a) the date of taking possession of the land or a date three months after the service of a notice in Form H referred to in subsection 16(1) in respect of the land, whichever is the earlier; or (b) a date three months after the service of a notice in Form Lc referred to in paragraph 35(2)(c) or Form R referred to in subsection 58(1) or section 59.”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_21__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (2), dengan menggantikan perkataan “eight” dengan perkataan “five”. Pindaan seksyen 32a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_22",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "22",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan seksyen 32a dengan seksyen yang berikut: “32a. For the purposes of sections 29a, 32 and 48, “payment” is deemed to have been made— (a) on the day as notified in writing by the Land Administrator that the payment is available for collection by the person interested; (b) on the day the payment is sent by registered post to the person interested; (c) on the day of the delivery of the payment by the Land Administrator to the Court; (d) on the day the payment is received by the person interested; or (e) on the day the payment is transmitted electronically to the account of the person interested.”. Pindaan seksyen 35"
      }
    },
