      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_34",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (2), dengan menggantikan perkataan “A certificate under the hand of the State Secretary” dengan perkataan “Any document”. Pindaan seksyen 57"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_35",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "35",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan seksyen 57 dengan seksyen yang berikut: “57. (1) Whenever it appears to the State Authority that the temporary occupation or use of any land is needed— (a) for any purpose specified in subsection 3(1); (b) in order to carry out public works on any land; or (c) as indicated in a development plan under the law applicable to it relating to town and country planning, the State Authority may direct the Land Administrator to procure the occupation or use of any such land for such term as he shall think fit, not exceeding three years from the date of commencement of such occupation or use, in the manner prescribed by this Part. (2) The Land Administrator or other registering authority shall make a note of any temporary occupation or use of land as specified under paragraphs 9(2)(a) and (b).”. Pindaan seksyen 58"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_36",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "36",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_36__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_36__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_36__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 58 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_36__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_36",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (1), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “shall make such offer of compensation” perkataan “in Form R”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_36__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_36",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (2) subseksyen yang berikut: “(2a) Prior to making an offer for compensation under subsection (1), the Land Administrator may obtain a written opinion on the value of the land from a valuer.”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_36__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_36",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (3) subseksyen yang berikut: “(4) In making any assessment of compensation under subsection (3), the Land Administrator may, whether by way of full or partial substitution for monetary compensation, enter into any arrangement with a person having an interest in such land in such a way as may be equitable, having regard to the interests of the parties concerned. (5) Whenever the Land Administrator enters into any arrangement under subsection (4), he shall make an entry of the particulars thereof in the appropriate register. (6) All the evidence during the enquiry and the amount of compensation offered shall be recorded by the Land Administrator. (7) Nothing in this section shall prevent the State Authority to occupy or use the land if the person interested is not agreeable to the compensation offered pursuant to subsection (1). (8) For the purpose of this section, subsection 14(5) shall be applicable if necessary.”. Pindaan seksyen 59"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_37",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "37",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 59 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “referred to in section 57” perkataan “, the Land Administrator shall make an enquiry to ensure that”. Pindaan seksyen 60"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_38",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "38",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 60 Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “Where the Land Administrator is unable to agree with the persons interested on the amount of compensation” dengan perkataan “Where the person interested is unable to agree on the amount of compensation offered by the Land Administrator”. Pindaan seksyen 65"
      }
    },
