      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 65 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “pursuant to section 3” perkataan “or Part VII”. Pindaan seksyen 66"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subperenggan 3c(2)(b)(ii) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “the Under Secretary of the Federal Territory Development and Klang Valley Planning Division, Prime Minister’s Department” dengan perkataan “a representative from the Ministry or agency responsible for the Federal Territory”. Pindaan seksyen 3f"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@/~cl_40",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "40",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/7/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
