        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (2) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(2) The State Director of Town and Country Planning or the local planning authority, upon receiving the request for information under subsection (1) shall provide the information required within two weeks from the request being made by the Land Administrator.”;"
